{"ayuktakusalaByan casevayam‌": [{"id": "AyuktakuSalAByAM cAsevAyAm‌", "headword": "आयुक्तकुशलाभ्यां चासेवायाम्‌", "headword_slp1": "AyuktakuSalAByAM cAsevAyAm‌", "fold": "ayuktakusalaByan casevayam‌", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "In conjunction with the words आयुक्त 'engaged', and कुशल 'skilful', when meaning entire absorption in an engagement, the 6th and the 7th case-affixes are used after a word.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-6, 7", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आयुक्तकुशलाभ्यां चासेवायाम्‌ २.३.४०", "२.३.४०", "२.३.४० आयुक्तकुशलाभ्यां चासेवायाम्‌"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AyuktakuSalAByAM cAsevAyAm‌ २.३.४०", "२.३.४०", "२.३.४० AyuktakuSalAByAM cAsevAyAm‌"]}], "ayuDajiviByasCaH parvate": [{"id": "AyuDajIviByaSCaH parvate", "headword": "आयुधजीविभ्यश्छः पर्वते", "headword_slp1": "AyuDajIviByaSCaH parvate", "fold": "ayuDajiviByasCaH parvate", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix छ comes after a word denoting 'mountain' in the sense of 'this is his mother-land', when it is a person who lives by arms.\n\nTerms: छ", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आयुधजीविभ्यश्छः पर्वते ४.३.९१", "४.३.९१", "४.३.९१ आयुधजीविभ्यश्छः पर्वते"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AyuDajIviByaSCaH parvate ४.३.९१", "४.३.९१", "४.३.९१ AyuDajIviByaSCaH parvate"]}], "ayuDacCa ca": [{"id": "AyuDAcCa ca", "headword": "आयुधाच्छ च", "headword_slp1": "AyuDAcCa ca", "fold": "ayuDacCa ca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affixes छ and ठन् come in the sense of 'he conveys thereby' after the word आयुध।\n\nTerms: छ and ठन्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आयुधाच्छ च ४.४.१४", "४.४.१४", "४.४.१४ आयुधाच्छ च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AyuDAcCa ca ४.४.१४", "४.४.१४", "४.४.१४ AyuDAcCa ca"]}], "ayuDajivisanGaYyaqvahikesvabrahmaRarajanyat‌": [{"id": "AyuDajIvisaMGAYYyaqvAhIkezvabrAhmaRarAjanyAt‌", "headword": "आयुधजीविसंघाञ्ञ्यड्वाहीकेष्वब्राह्मणराजन्यात्‌", "headword_sl